Keep the GitHub repository picker on screen on phones.

The repo and branch comboboxes in the new-session form open a popover of a
search field and a list up to 18rem tall, about 330px in all. A phone has less
room than that both above and below the picker, so Radix flipped the popover
to the top and it ran off the top of the screen, search field first. The
popover is now capped at the room Radix finds (8px off the screen edges) and
the list scrolls inside it. On touch screens the search field also isn't
focused on open, so the on-screen keyboard doesn't pop up and pan the page;
tapping the field focuses it. Desktop, with room to spare, is unchanged.
Base: omnigent v0.15.0 (c8b9b85f822f), after 0001-0005.

